WEBVTT

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:04.169
Hey, I want to share my personal
experience with NZXT Flex and give my

00:00:04.179 --> 00:00:05.239
opinions about it.

00:00:06.019 --> 00:00:09.629
Um, NZXT Flex was best for me
because I wanted to get a PC,

00:00:09.639 --> 00:00:12.639
but didn't know how to build one
and couldn't afford high-end parts.

00:00:13.039 --> 00:00:15.629
Now that I've been with NZXT
Flex for a couple years,

00:00:15.639 --> 00:00:19.509
I can play games effortlessly and not
worry about the cost of repairments if

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:20.579
something were to happen.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:24.469
The customer support team has helped
me a ton during my rental subscription

00:00:24.479 --> 00:00:27.559
with payment issues and PC replacements.

00:00:27.839 --> 00:00:30.849
I really love how they're very
lenient and understanding with you.

00:00:30.859 --> 00:00:33.169
There's been times where I couldn't
afford to make the payment on a certain

00:00:33.179 --> 00:00:36.150
date, but they allowed me to push back
the date and help me come up with a

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:37.829
time that would be best for me.

00:00:37.839 --> 00:00:42.689
I highly recommend NZXT Flex for
its affordability and its support,

00:00:42.699 --> 00:00:45.039
and thank you to everyone that
has helped me continue gaming.
